    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe Nocturn is a game where you arrive in a small village on the coast of Japan to take over management of a cozy cafe on a hill overlooking the ocean.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a while, you notice that things in the village aren't quite right. In this tale of curses and Japanese horror folklore, you're courage will be tested, but you'll always have a place to relax in the safety of you're cafe... <i>as long as you follow her rules...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your cafe and serve customers with different drinks to make money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and engage with the lovely residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your cafe stocked and decorated with the various shopping destinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cafe with a range of customization options and easy to use editing system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stock and keep everything organized</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget... you can't just go on a leisurely stroll to the shops, it isn't safe out there...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More details and images to be announced and posted. Please follow using</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@nocturngamesdev on Youtube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > @nocturngames on X, TIktok, and Instagram</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe Nocturn is a game where you arrive in a small village on the coast of Japan to take over management of a cozy cafe on a hill overlooking the ocean.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a while, you notice that things in the village aren't quite right. In this tale of curses and Japanese horror folklore, you're courage will be tested, but you'll always have a place to relax in the safety of you're cafe... <i>as long as you follow her rules...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your cafe and serve customers with different drinks to make money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and engage with the lovely residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your cafe stocked and decorated with the various shopping destinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cafe with a range of customization options and easy to use editing system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stock and keep everything organized</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget... you can't just go on a leisurely stroll to the shops, it isn't safe out there...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More details and images to be announced and posted. Please follow using</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@nocturngamesdev on Youtube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > @nocturngames on X, TIktok, and Instagram</p>",
